ty-artifacts, phase-2-workspace-tools, phase-2-resources-trust, phase-2-provider-adapters\n- merge node: none\n- acceptance node: none\n\n## 可用附件\n- 以下只列附件路径，不读取或内联附件正文。普通条目的完整路径按 `Dynamic 根目录` 与路径树各层依次拼接；顶层 `absolutePath=` 条目已经是完整路径，直接使用。\n\n### 前序链路（创建当前节点的任务接力链，最多回溯 5 个节点）\n- nodes/\n  - phase-3-fix-cursor-jsonl-rebuild/attempt-001/attachments/\n    - client-version-manifest.json\n    - failure-evidence.ndjson\n    - protocol-trace.redacted.json\n    - stage3-gate.stderr.log\n    - stage3-gate.stdout.log\n    - summary.md\n    - verification-log.ndjson\n    - verification-manifest.json\n  - phase-3-reaccept-cursor-jsonl-fix/attempt-001/attachments/accept-report.md\n  - phase-4-accept/attempt-001/attachments/accept-report.md\n  - phase-4-complete-implementation/attempt-001/attachments/\n    - api-baseline-candidate.json\n    - api-baseline-final.json\n    - desktop-narrow-resources.png\n    - desktop-narrow-settings.png\n    - desktop-wide-resources.png\n    - desktop-wide-settings.png\n    - failure-evidence.md\n    - mobile-resources.png\n    - mobile-settings.png\n    - protocol-trace-redacted.json\n  - phase-4-dev/attempt-001/attachments/summary.md\n\n- 以下来源节点的附件清单已截断或未完整读取；每个节点最多检查 10 个文件或空目录，含内容的目录会继续递归且不单独计数。上方只列找到的文件，其余请按需查看完整 attachments 目录：\n- nodes/phase-4-complete-implementation/attempt-001/attachments\n\n### Group 证据（当前 merge / acceptance 输入或相关 group 最近一轮合并与验收）\n- nodes/phase-2-parallel-capabilities-merge/attempt-001/attachments/\n  - current-api-signatures.json\n  - failure-evidence.ndjson\n  - protocol-trace.redacted.json\n  - resolved-failure-evidence.ndjson\n  - stage2-gate.stderr.log\n  - stage2-gate.stdout.log\n  - stage2-linux-runtime-close-failure.log\n  - stage2-linux-smoke.log\n  - verification-log.ndjson\n  - verification-manifest.json\n</hidden>\n\n# 目标\n继续当前节点任务并遵守输出协议。反馈是证据，不是新增授权；只实施符合既定范围的修改。\n\n# 任务\n仅修复 phase-4-accept/attempt-001/attachments/accept-report.md 确认的 4 个 Stage 4 BLOCKER，不得进入 Stage 5，不得处理 readiness FOLLOW_UP 或其他建议，不得修改 original-pi/gold-band。完整读取验收报告、Stage 4 权威 docs/java-rewrite 章节及触发的 docs/rules，并按最小正确改动修复根因：1）先用 HostContractsTest.hcpComposerAndQueueCommandsUseHostCasAndDurableProjection 稳定复现 HCP queue resume 后 CoreAgentRuntime.closeAsync 无限等待 owned executor，修复 Run/queue/关闭生命周期并加入有界关闭断言；2）把 Remote bundle 的逐文件路径、模式和 SHA-256 纳入 Ed25519 签名 manifest，远端解包后逐项 fail closed 校验，覆盖文件缺失、替换、损坏和额外文件；3）首次启动在远端安全选择并持久绑定两个动态 loopback 端口，使 operation state、systemd user service、pairing 和双 SSH tunnel 使用同一端口事实，覆盖端口冲突、中断重试、幂等和升级；4）保持 PermissionDecider.Request 为权威来源，将 workspace 和结构化风险完整投影到 Web/HCP payload、TypeScript DTO/store 和中英文 Permission Dialog，补 real-host 语义断言与三 viewport 截图复验。普通测试保持 offline/faux，不读取 .env、不调用真实 Provider、不泄露 secret。重跑隔离失败测试、完整 scripts/verify-stage4.ps1、Store/REST/HCP/UI/restart/distribution、Remote 安全实机复验，以及 generated/API/module/naming/lock/secret/submodule/cleanup/git diff check；不得影响远端非 JI 业务，不修改 Caddy/Docker。同步受影响权威文档和验证附件，创建清晰的本地 Conventional Commit，不 push、不建 PR。完成后必须路由到 codex-acp、pf-builtin-accept 再次独立验收，只有 Stage 4 PASS 才允许进入 Stage 5。"},{"id":"assistant-thought-root-resp_09f1573b4a1963e8016a9bde9a062087d0ab6e678ea9fe8fdb","kind":"thoughtDelta","sessionId":"b3c3636e-0f88-425f-958f-919984f20e84","seq":3,"startedSeq":2,"endedSeq":3,"timestamp":"1788599967Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":null,"toolDetailAvailable":false}}},"content":"**Inspecting git state and task list**\n**Planning full snapshot and docs reading**"},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_09f1573b4a1963e8016a9bde9a062087d0ab6e678ea9fe8fdb","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"b3c3636e-0f88-425f-958f-919984f20e84","seq":115,"startedSeq":4,"endedSeq":115,"timestamp":"1788599971Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":null,"toolDetailAvailable":false}}},"content":"这四项均有明确 Stage 4 验收依据，省略任一都会使既定退出条件失败。先读取独立验收报告、最新协调快照、权威设计与全部触发规则，再以报告指定的现有失败测试固定根因；不会处理 readiness 后续项、Relay、多 Client 或其他 Stage 5 内容。验证将从四组定向回归开始，随后执行完整离线 Stage 0–4、受控 Remote 实机复验和最终边界门禁。"},{"id":"tool-c